{"id":"656746","name":"排骨烧鹌鹑蛋","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/656746/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鹌鹑蛋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净。","img":"images/656746/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鹌鹑蛋煮熟去壳备用。","img":"images/656746/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中热油放入姜片炒香。","img":"images/656746/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"排骨下锅翻炒。","img":"images/656746/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入生抽，蚝油，老抽。","img":"images/656746/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色入味。","img":"images/656746/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"转入珐琅锅后加入清水。","img":"images/656746/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大火煮开转小火焖40分钟左右。","img":"images/656746/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"分钟后放入鹌鹑蛋。","img":"images/656746/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"继续焖15分钟左右上色入味后收汁即可。","img":"images/656746/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656746/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656746/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656746/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：焖烧锅、砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}